DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:M365Group SIA\nČiekurkalna 2. līnija 49A - 3, Rīga, LV-1026\n\nhttp://www.m365group.eu/\n\n\nManage booking\n-------------------------------------\nhttps://outlook.office.com/book/Interview@m365connect.com/id/Oa2IgxPsIkSyLH98lQ5LtQ2?isAnonymous=true\n\nAdditional Information\n-------------------------------------\nInterview Details: Duration: Approximately 0.5 hour Platform: Microsoft Teams DESKTOP (Video Interview) (https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-teams/download-app) &nbsp; Joining Instructions: You will receive a Microsoft Teams invitation link a few hours before the scheduled interview. Please join NOW (you can join anytime) and check in the Lobby that you can join it with the link given and also your headset, camera, internet. Please join the meeting at least 15 minutes before the scheduled start time, as we do not tolerate delays. Once you are in the meeting, please wait until we admit you from the virtual lobby. Optional Notification: You may notify us once you have joined the meeting for our awareness. As soon as you got MS Teams Desktop downloaded and installed let us know and also send us a screenshot as evidence for it. Keep in mind that disregarding any of these instructions will automatically disqualify you. Especially if you join the call not from MS Teams Desktop Version. So make sure to join with the Desktop Version. Test your devices and join the call upfront to fix any technical issues.Note\n-------------------------------------\n<div></div>\nJoin the Teams Meeting from your mobile web browser\nhttps://visit.teams.microsoft.com/webrtc-svc/api/route?tid=dd83f20e-c004-40c1-8e55-c0fccb22c4ab&convId=19:meeting_NTJmZmNmZWQtNmQyOS00YWQ0LTk3YTUtYWYyMjNmODhlMDYz@thread.v2&oid=8eb3ee5a-f91e-43a5-a0b6-a53d1aa00633&JoinWebUrl=https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NTJmZmNmZWQtNmQyOS00YWQ0LTk3YTUtYWYyMjNmODhlMDYz%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22dd83f20e-c004-40c1-8e55-c0fccb22c4ab%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22